  "question": {
    "text": "Passing $\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{~S}$ gas into a mixture of $\\mathrm{Mn}^{2+}, \\mathrm{Ni}^{2+}, \\mathrm{Cu}^{2+}$ and $\\mathrm{Hg}^{2+}$ ions in an acidified aqueous solution precipitates",
